sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Content script
  participant W as Service worker
  participant B as FastAPI backend
  participant M as AWS Bedrock
  participant V as Voice APIs
  U->>W: Hold key and say fill out this form
  W->>V: Audio to STT chain Groq first
  V-->>W: Transcript
  W->>B: POST task with screenshot DOM and Firecrawl markdown
  B->>M: converse call
  M-->>B: needs_clarification with question
  B-->>W: JSON response
  W->>C: tts-summary with the question
  C->>V: Fetch ElevenLabs speech through the worker
  C-->>W: tts-playback-finished
  W->>W: AwaitingReply so mic reopens for 10 s
  U->>W: Speak name and email
  W->>B: POST task with reply in history
  B-->>W: type action with exact selector
